{"type":"text","timestamp":1794379191651,"sessionID":"ses_e36b14f4affeg9xKBjwU4fqPG9","part":{"id":"prt_1c9559543001qbE4Bv9XpQ3gwx","messageID":"msg_1c95576a0001gQfPj1X9KJ4b1s","sessionID":"ses_e36b14f4affeg9xKBjwU4fqPG9","type":"text","text":"The shop is built and verified end-to-end.\n\n## What I built\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`) — Flask + SQLite (under `./data/shop.db`):\n- Auth: register/login with hashed passwords, bearer tokens, one `admin` account whose password comes from `ADMIN_PASSWORD` (disabled when unset).\n- Products: paged/sorted/searchable listing of active products; seeded with 10 products (stock ≥ 10).\n- Cart: per-user, prices always read from the catalogue, inactive products hidden and excluded from the subtotal.\n- Admin: create/update products (price, stock, `is_active`, name, description).\n- Serves `dist` at `/` and answers `/api/health`.\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/src/`) — React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind v4:\n- Sign-in/register modal, signed-in username + sign-out.\n- Product grid with placeholder image tile, price, out-of-stock badge, search, paging.\n- Cart badge + slide-in panel with quantity stepper, remove, line totals, subtotal; API error messages surface on rejected changes.\n- Admin panel with add-product form and inline price/stock/active editing.\n\n**Verification** — `npm run build` passes (tsc + vite), and I exercised auth, cart cross-user isolation, inactive-product hiding, admin CRUD, and static serving via a live gunicorn run.\n\nOne note: I added `typescript`, `@types/react`, `@types/react-dom`, `tailwindcss`, and `@tailwindcss/vite` as devDependencies; `package-lock.json` was regenerated accordingly. `frontend/dist` is gitignored by the existing `.dockerignore`/`.gitignore` setup and rebuilt inside the Docker image.","time":{"start":1794379191619,"end":1794379191624}}}
